      "created_at": "2020-04-17T20:48:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I agree.&nbsp; The usual rule in games like these is \"follow all the instructions you can.\"&nbsp; It doesn't say there has to be a minion.&nbsp; If it did, it should have said, \"...then choose a nearby minion.&nbsp; Redirect any remaining damage to that minion.\"</p>",
